  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d29874e3b4e59e549ab8ca779e34be5a, type: 3}
  m_Name: Ice_0-Introduction to Ice Galaxy
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: T.I.I.G.E.R
  paragraphs:
  - "Unbelievable, you\u2019re here? You must have cheated in some way. No human
    golfer could ever survive those hazardous stars."
  - No matter, even if you really did complete that course, this galaxy contains
    neutron stars. Their strong magnetic fields will repel your golf ball away from
    their cores.
  - "To ensure you don\u2019t cheat in this one, I\u2019ll be closely monitoring
    your progress from now on."
